%!PS-Adobe-3.0 EPSF-3.0
%%BoundingBox: 0 0 216 144
%%Title: annual-legacy (the Paged Annual's legacy-format exhibit)
%%Creator: authored by hand for this repository
%%EndComments
% This file's job is to EXIST and be recognisably EPS. The engine
% deliberately does NOT decode PostScript: a placed EPS renders as an
% honest placeholder (name + box), never as a silent blank and never as
% a fake preview. The drawing below is real, minimal PostScript - a
% plate outline and a diagonal - so any PS interpreter shows the same
% mark the placeholder stands in for.
% (c) And The Next GmbH - AGPL-3.0-only OR PMEL, like the rest of the
% editor repository. Not a third-party asset.
newpath 12 12 moveto 204 12 lineto 204 132 lineto 12 132 lineto closepath
0.11 0.25 0.58 setrgbcolor fill
newpath 12 12 moveto 204 132 lineto 0.85 0.31 0.17 setrgbcolor 6 setlinewidth stroke
newpath 24 60 moveto 96 60 lineto 96 84 lineto 24 84 lineto closepath
0.96 0.95 0.92 setrgbcolor fill
showpage
%%EOF
